Rem ==================================================================
Rem test.shoddy — the pure fixture's headless golden suite. A mill
Rem without headless tests cannot claim Mode N (A2.3); this one can.
Rem ==================================================================

Include "pure-core.shoddy"

Def Main()
    Assert(Grade(SampleOf("A", 70)) = "PASS", "GRADE PASS")
    Assert(Grade(SampleOf("B", 30)) = "FAIL", "GRADE FAIL")
    Assert(Score(Scale(SampleOf("C", 10), 3)) = 30, "SCALE")
    Assert(Label(Scale(SampleOf("C", 10), 3)) = "C", "SCALE KEEPS LABEL")
